Z||000022||lowCG||10-13-1999||12:25 AM||||If I had a digital camera,I would,but picture a 46" wide X 16" piece of sheet metal,centered under the nose,with the rear part(where it butts up against the  factory airdam)sticking downwards,past the factory airdam a couple of inches,for a total now of <BR>4 1/2" X 46" of airdam.<BR>I need to make some pieces to go on the outsides of the 4 1/2" dam,continued around to the wheelwells.||||reg||1
